{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:834ed7f37791d761","name":"Cosmetic Enhancements","source":{"id":"source:reference-834ed7f37791d761","title":"Cosmetic Enhancements","revision":20125,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:15:51Z","sha256":"4336938e71d986d6e17da7cf3a3fa1715e7a4c6e36899170c2e9a149fe48c2e5","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20125","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Cosmetic%20Enhancements&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-834ed7f37791d761","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 200\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["More common and less risky than other Yuuzhan Vong ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bio-Implants"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bio-Implants"},", Cosmetic Enhancements include tattoos, reshaping of bone structure, alterations to skin or hair color, superficial scarring, the addition of bony protrusions, and so forth. These cosmetic changes do not require an attack roll against the recipient's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"}," and ignore the normal rules for penalties on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," checks. Cosmetic Enhancements do not alter the statistics of their recipients in any way.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
